has before Number
has after Number
Removed Number
	before - after
HasRemoved Boolean
	if before > after
		return true
	false
to Text
	"before=" + before to Text + " after=" + after to Text + " removed=" + Removed to Text
Create(beforeCount Number, afterCount Number) OptimizerStats
	Create(5, 2).Removed is 3
	OptimizerStats(beforeCount, afterCount)
Empty OptimizerStats
	OptimizerStats(0, 0)